        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Daniel%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Aaron Daniels first settled the area known as Daniel in 1874.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Daniel%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Earlier names for the community included Lake Creek and Center Creek, which were each small settlements by their respective creeks.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://onlineutah.us/danielhistory.shtml"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "While Center Creek still exists, the settlement of Lake Creek was eventually absorbed into Heber City.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://onlineutah.us/danielhistory.shtml"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Daniel officially incorporated as a town in February 2006.",
